# Items Backend Ground Truth

Created: 2026-02-02 UTC
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 UTC

## Models
- `ItemBase`: `title` (min 1, max 255), `description` (optional, max 255).
- `Item`: adds `id` (UUID PK), `created_at` (UTC), `owner_id` (FK user.id), `owner` relationship.
- `ItemPublic`: `id`, `owner_id`, `created_at` plus base fields.
- `ItemsPublic`: `data` (list of ItemPublic), `count`.

Sources: `demo/full-stack-fastapi-template/backend/app/models.py`.

## API Routes
- `GET /items`: superuser sees all items; non-superuser sees only items where `owner_id == current_user.id`. Returns `ItemsPublic` with total count.
- `GET /items/{id}`: returns item if exists; non-superuser blocked unless owner.
- `POST /items`: creates item owned by current user.
- `PUT /items/{id}`: updates item if exists and user has permission.
- `DELETE /items/{id}`: deletes item if exists and user has permission.

Sources: `demo/full-stack-fastapi-template/backend/app/api/routes/items.py`.
